Game Doc For the Salmon River:


Basic Concept:


Player actions:
Move:
Duck: avoids air thrown things and hits on the ground. If done while jumping makes you untargetable for a short time

Jump: avoids ground thrown things

Hit/Use: If you have nothing in hand and you manage to hit the opponent with something in hand 1dmg and steal that item. Hitting with each item has different effects.

Catch/Throw: If Nothing is in you hand you can catch and item in the air. If close to the opponent, grab them and throw them away (Unduckable). Each item does a different thing when thrown.

Items:

Salmon: Use: Eat and gain 1hp, you next Hit does 2dmg. Throw: 1dmg
Chunk of ice: Use: Dash in a direction, If hits an opponent they get staggered. Throw: 1dmg and a stagger.
Stick: Use: Long range attack Throw: A range attack that hits both in the air and on the ground.


